{"3969150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beauty Store Simulator", "steam_appid": 3969150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beauty Store Simulator is a vibrant first-person simulation where you take on the role of a beauty mogul, managing your own beauty store empire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💄 Cosmetics 💍 Jewelry 👗 Fashion 💅 Nail Care</strong><br><strong>💇‍♀️ Hair Salon 💆‍♀️ Spa 🎀 Accessories 🧴 Skincare</strong><br><strong>💅 Manicure &amp; Pedicure 💋 Makeup Counter 👑 Luxury Goods</strong><br><strong>👜 Handbags 👠 Shoes 💎 Diamond Collection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>…and much more to discover as you build, customize, and expand your beauty business to become the ultimate beauty destination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store, attract customers, and become the go-to beauty destination in NY CITY. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming to become a beauty mogul or simply enjoy managing a stylish boutique, Beauty Store Simulator lets you build your dream store and experience the exciting world of beauty retail in a fun, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the journey doesn’t stop there—Beauty Store Simulator now offers even more depth with enhanced management features:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/c69b764c66e2ff9ece2550e18ff37e35.webp?t=1786936332\" width=540 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your store’s visibility by collaborating with popular beauty influencers for live streaming events. Watch as traffic soars and sales spike with every successful broadcast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d45136cde2c194b38c59c1001510c65b.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d45136cde2c194b38c59c1001510c65b.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/d45136cde2c194b38c59c1001510c65b.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/c0edeccaefbf4c41c6475f3e196fadf1.webp?t=1786936332\" width=316 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire janitorial staff to maintain a spotless shopping environment. A clean store not only pleases customers but also helps uphold your brand’s prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/59f0286869b90d46b19fe663467e1ffe.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/59f0286869b90d46b19fe663467e1ffe.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/59f0286869b90d46b19fe663467e1ffe.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/9adf3639b367c436dc45425572326771.webp?t=1786936332\" width=393 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thieves occasionally lurk among shoppers. Employ security personnel to deter pickpockets and prevent losses, ensuring a safe experience for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2ec55390371fc01e88fd29718af9c6b9.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2ec55390371fc01e88fd29718af9c6b9.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2ec55390371fc01e88fd29718af9c6b9.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/1596b4112405ef062c8c85ae814a6dc8.webp?t=1786936332\" width=455 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring in restock assistants to keep shelves fully stocked and organized. Never miss a sale due to empty displays again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/795889b18a477aa6f8ae9318382ef5fa.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/795889b18a477aa6f8ae9318382ef5fa.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/795889b18a477aa6f8ae9318382ef5fa.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/514ae84fa9e4485f71cf1351d34f388e.webp?t=1786936332\" width=500 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire assistant managers to handle checkout efficiently, reduce waiting times, and even upsell products—making every transaction smooth and profitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b9aee646701be73ad4112c8b7a77d775.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b9aee646701be73ad4112c8b7a77d775.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b9aee646701be73ad4112c8b7a77d775.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/83125f6df2131e24991a23ef653abb9e.webp?t=1786936332\" width=392 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store with hair salon services. Offer cuts, coloring, and styling to keep customers coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" aut