in or shine, customer traffic varies, so plan your strategy accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/3c69b77d19cdc495326f77eea37b4fe3.webp?t=1786936332\" width=427 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your beauty empire to the next level by expanding into hair salons, spa treatments, and more! As your beauty store flourishes, diversify your offerings and dominate the beauty industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dream of becoming a beauty mogul or simply enjoy curating a stylish shopping experience, Beauty Store Simulator offers a fun, interactive, and richly detailed environment to build your dream store and dominate the world of beauty retail.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beauty Store Simulator is a vibrant first-person simulation where you take on the role of a beauty mogul, managing your own beauty store empire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💄 Cosmetics 💍 Jewelry 👗 Fashion 💅 Nail Care</strong><br><strong>💇‍♀️ Hair Salon 💆‍♀️ Spa 🎀 Accessories 🧴 Skincare</strong><br><strong>💅 Manicure &amp; Pedicure 💋 Makeup Counter 👑 Luxury Goods</strong><br><strong>👜 Handbags 👠 Shoes 💎 Diamond Collection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>…and much more to discover as you build, customize, and expand your beauty business to become the ultimate beauty destination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store, attract customers, and become the go-to beauty destination in NY CITY. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're aiming to become a beauty mogul or simply enjoy managing a stylish boutique, Beauty Store Simulator lets you build your dream store and experience the exciting world of beauty retail in a fun, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/2a99d764c7a95be06509261b66fd114c.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the journey doesn’t stop there—B