varies, so plan your strategy accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/e7f22e3e2b8df5a8a5b454b2ea636af3.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/3c69b77d19cdc495326f77eea37b4fe3.webp?t=1786936332\" width=427 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your beauty empire to the next level by expanding into hair salons, spa treatments, and more! As your beauty store flourishes, diversify your offerings and dominate the beauty industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.poster.avif?t=1786936332\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.webm?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/extras/b72a55977dee01dc69fec18ead19a02b.mp4?t=1786936332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dream of becoming a beauty mogul or simply enjoy curating a stylish shopping experience, Beauty Store Simulator offers a fun, interactive, and richly detailed environment to build your dream store and dominate the world of beauty retail.</p>", "short_description": "Run your own beauty store in Beauty Store Simulator! Manage a variety of cosmetics, fashion items, jewelry, and more. Design your store, keep customers happy, and build a successful beauty empire. Can you become the ultimate beauty mogul?", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Korean, Dutch", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/de6d45ba3a4a6b86f367f8746e5d63510ca127b5/header.jpg?t=1786936332", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/0f7e46f7916ece617ce35f869781c128b9bf95a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786936332", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969150/0f7e46f7916ece617ce35f869781c128b9bf95a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786936332", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-4670 / AMD Ryzen3 1300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD  RX-480<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-13600K / AMD Ryzen5 9600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 2070 / AMD  RX 6650 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Ve